  "notes": "Only the nRF52840 Expansion 2x20 header is a physical wiring point with a pin table. Other callouts (LoRa, AMOLED, touch, SD card, HDMI, camera, WiFi, AHT20, MAX98357A) list internal GPIO assignments and are skipped per rule 1. The pin table is printed as two columns beside the header; left table column assigned to the left (inner) holes and right table column to the right (outer) holes.",
  "uncertain": [
    "Label-to-hole mapping is inferred: the 20x2 label table is printed beside the header (not aligned to individual holes); assumed table left/right columns correspond to header left/right columns and table rows run top-to-bottom with the header rows.",
    "A black arrow points at the top row of the header; it may mark pin 1 (top-right hole), but it is not labeled '1'."
  ]
